claim: why a unit is withheld — dangling-citation, or any verdict but supported — as @cram/shared's WithheldReason declares it
cite: `WithheldReason`
sweep: dangling-citation|`WithheldReason`|\.claude/ledgers/withheld-reasons\.ledger
carrier: packages/shared/src/verification.test.ts
carrier: packages/shared/src/unit.ts
carrier: packages/shared/src/withheld.ts
carrier: packages/grounding/src/resolve-citations.ts
carrier: packages/grounding/src/resolve-citations.test.ts
carrier: packages/grounding/src/ground.test.ts
carrier: apps/web/src/copy.ts
carrier: apps/web/src/copy.test.ts
carrier: docs/standards/grounding.md
carrier: docs/adr/0005-evaluation-as-gate.md
excluded: docs/tech-debt.md
